OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's lies led to innocent man's
OL,4,Adetention
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose lies about a man led to
OL,7,Fhim being held in prison for more than
OL,8,Fa month has been given a suspended
OL,9,Fsentence.
OL,11,FEmma Hook, 37, told police the man
OL,12,Fthreatened her with a zombie knife,
OL,13,Fwhich led to him being held on remand
OL,14,Fawaiting trial, Newcastle Crown Court
OL,15,Fheard.
OL,17,FShe was rumbled after she made similar
OL,18,Fallegations against a woman months
OL,19,Flater, the court heard.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
